From f7b8fdc6bde52a51f3afb0b85a33da11e40521ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prem <prem.karnan@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Mar 2026 09:18:03 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix blank content, broken calculators, and alignment issues

- Remove js-ready animation system that caused blank/invisible content
  on all pages. Content now always visible with subtle additive animations.
- Fix homepage gold calculator and EMI calculator (selectors used
  name attributes but HTML uses id attributes)
- Fix mortgage page EMI calculator (standalone handler)
- Fix counter animation to properly display prefix/suffix
- Fix SME 5-column steps grid with responsive breakpoints
- Fix invalid CSS variable --border-radius-md to --radius-md across
  gold-loan, mortgage-loan, sme-loan, investors pages
- Fix undefined --text CSS variable in policies page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
